# Review

The pull request targets the recorded active branch. Record the active branch when the task starts. Create the work branch from it and target the PR back into that recorded branch. Target `main` only if `main` was the recorded active branch.

Check the diff against DESIGN.md, CODE_STYLE.md, and BRANCHING.md. Report:

- Hardcoded colors
- Files over the line limit
- A diff over the pull request line cap
- Missing tests
- A branch name that is not `<type>/<short-kebab-description>`, or that adds a tool, agent, or author prefix
- A pull request that does not target the recorded branch

Do not merge. On an agent-safe branch, a human merges. Agents never merge their own pull requests.
